c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "get ur horror movies out lads"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1670.894, "timestamp": "00:27:50", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "w horror"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1671.07, "timestamp": "00:27:51", "text": "我應該多玩恐怖"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1673.83, "timestamp": "00:27:53", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "then we can watch 3 and 4"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1675.11, "timestamp": "00:27:55", "text": "遊戲，因為…在日本的時候，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1678.149, "timestamp": "00:27:58", "text": "不會再讓我玩恐怖遊戲了，因為噪音投訴在那邊是真實存在的。每個人都住在狹小封閉的空間裡，牆壁很薄等等"}]